{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"29f5e286c1d1ecb4","type":"text","text":"In this aera Askain began to experiment with arcane research from the age of arcana specifically focused on Armount. The head of the arcane research was a woman named Azest Thyless. During her research she uncovered The Tomb of The Fallen Champion where The Dreamers Heart has been hidden away for the past 2000 years. This discovery eventually attracted the attention of the Whispered one.\n\nThe story of Askain Pre Unhileg:\n\nAskain was currently being ruled by a woman named Asala Askain a peaceful woman who fostered peace an prosperity. Askain and Volstar had a sibling nation like relationship with open boarders. During this time the nobel houses of Askain.\n\nCouncil members\n\n[[Azest Thyless.canvas]] - Drow - woman\n\nNromindrought, Vilakro - Dragon Born- man\n\nAskain, Asala - High Elf - woman\n\nReymindrad, Xenphor - Aasimar - man\n\nNoble houses\n\n[[Gabriel Draemont.canvas]] - Human - man\n\nSindratho, Elana - Human - woman\n\nVernatho, Xindratos - Drow - man\n\nBingdrag, Zimlin - Gnome - man\n\nAll took part in a portion of the nation's prosperity and lived either within the capital city Askain or cities named after them.\n\nAzest Thylss spent her life for 100 years since she was a child practicing Dunamancy and began to fully tap into it when she discovered the Dreamers Heart at age 100.\n\nUpon discovering the Dreamers heart she brought it to the queen to discuss how they would use it and what they could do with it. With The Dreamers Heart in her possession she became more powerful than ever before and the artifact is the direct reasoning why. After being unable to truly ascertain why the artifact was able to empower her to this extent she began relying on the Draemonts for assistance as they were experts with using residuum as a catalyst to enhance human capability.\n\nAfter a few years of study Gabriel Draemont became hungry for the power of The Dreamers Heart and was jealous of the political stature Azest was gaining as a result of its power.\n\nConsumed by greed and lust he reached out to the continent of necromancers telling them he would share his findings with them if they aided him in taking the power it held from Azest.","x":-207,"y":-175,"width":787,"height":1055},
		{"id":"ddf6b4cbf4c96db2","x":-337,"y":-343,"width":337,"height":83,"type":"text","text":"[[The Rise of The Whispered one.canvas]]\n#Lore "}
